                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "2WePP",
                  "name": "r1b",
                  "fill": "#505967",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "• Clean, well-lit professional environments\n• Swiss office settings and architecture\n• Hands working with documents and screens\n• Minimal, uncluttered compositions\n• Natural light, neutral color grading\n• Abstract geometric patterns for backgrounds\n• Data visualization and dashboard screenshots",
